    <div class="gbc-legend">
      <span class="gbc-legend-item"><span class="gbc-swatch zd"></span>Selection driver (pre-purchase)</span>
      <span class="gbc-legend-item"><span class="gbc-swatch sf"></span>Frustration (post-purchase)</span>
